ndex":401,"locator":"[S23T18]","raw_turn_sha256":"c8c5a2cf97d2bb8d61e4256faed99fb9c1f77cabeeba7c92b0e070ce5a9a8533","rendered_turn_sha256":"f7834e51e76e50edfc2b013b334d0e85fae82ee0b65757eeaca85e284368da4b","session_date":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"df7c2177982afc61a478d0a0dcf934cf7b68c0e2766fee9fc08bac06e3c17f43","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Yeah, Calvin! The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.\n[S23T11] (dia_id: D23:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, Dave! Music and repairing things are so fulfilling and satisfying. Seeing something go from broken to whole is incredible. You're making a difference too - it's amazing. Keep it up, friend.\n[S23T12] (dia_id: D23:12)\n\nDave: Thanks, buddy. Your support really helps. It's great to have a friend who believes in me. I'll keep pushing.\n[S23T13] (dia_id: D23:13)\n\nCalvin: I believe in you, Dave. Keep pushing and never forget how awesome you are.\n[S23T14] (dia_id: D23:14)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and not forget my value!\n[S23T15] (dia_id: D23:15)\n\nCalvin: C'mon, remember how great you are! Keep going for those dreams. You got this! You know what Dave? Last week, I got a new Ferrari! It's a masterpiece on wheels. Excited for thrilling rides and unforgettable journeys! Perhaps a photo of this unique beauty will lift your mood.\n[Image caption: a photography of a black sports car parked in front of a building]\n[S23T16] (dia_id: D23:16)\n\nDave: Wow! Thanks a ton for the kind words and encouragement! Your positivity is contagious. Congratulations on the new Ferrari – that's incredible! Must be one amazing ride. I'm all in for those thrilling journeys! Feel free to share a pic of your new beauty whenever you're ready. Let's keep the good vibes rolling! Take care and see you later!\n[S23T17] (dia_id: D23:17)\n\nCalvin: The Ferrari is indeed a showstopper. I'll be sure to share a pic soon. Here's to more thrilling rides and positive vibes. Take care, and looking forward to catching up soon!\n[S23T18] (dia_id: D23:18)","text_sha256":"ee070f89e8e59d14197fd73e16702eb2e5e68df79f8277c8b37c45e00df3704e","timestamp":"2023-10-15T09:39:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D12:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S12T1]"],"text_sha256":"7974b934fe44a2bb90646003a4a439b79eb69f47a65f48b129305009905e5217"},{"dia_ids":["D12:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S12T2]"],"text_sha256":"df1948bc300331bf2dccbd4a818e3335cf8498da9297cd52906a947da0343001"},{"dia_ids":["D12:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S12T3]"],"text_sha256":"87a321657a3a49e8ee8d8c318d9b774fb62a97a3372df18b5962e80bb1661fc9"},{"dia_ids":["D12:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S12T4]"],"text_sha256":"03ea2fef9dc3245dac192501aa2e6987e54a76fdc80935a28cf0739e0ce8ac6d"},{"dia_ids":["D12:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S12T5]"],"text_sha256":"baa37e46f0e83e342adcbd441df00d0b13ba13b9a49b5efffe31e91e13b4c604"},{"dia_ids":["D12:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S12T6]"],"text_sha256":"5f111995f18641948fa037087100285702359659488035470fa830706d1c427b"},{"dia_ids":["D12:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":33,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S12T7]"],"text_sha256":"763b2f6e468b1c258928e45b93c947733c784952a591501817bcf80a9237f30b"},{"dia_ids":["D12:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_en