sign and engineering.\n[S4T5] (dia_id: D4:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Going for it with classic cars is cool! Fulfilling your dreams is so important.\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car parked in a parking lot]\n[S4T6] (dia_id: D4:6)\n\nDave: I'm obsessed with classic cars. They have a unique charm. I was so thrilled to restore one last year—nothing like bringing it back to life! Take a look at the engine of the restored car.\n[Image caption: a photo of a car engine with a small air filter]\n[S4T7] (dia_id: D4:7)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! That looks awesome!\n[S4T8] (dia_id: D4:8)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It was a labor of love. Challenging, but so worth it.\n[S4T9] (dia_id: D4:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's awesome when you see something you worked on come to life.\n[S4T10] (dia_id: D4:10)\n\nDave: Yeah! It feels great to see the hard work pay off, it's like bringing something back to life.\n[S4T11] (dia_id: D4:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's an amazing feeling when you create something and it resonates with people. It's so satisfying when you finish something you made from scratch!\n[S4T12] (dia_id: D4:12)\n\nDave: Yeah, Calvin! It's such an amazing feeling to see something you create become a reality. Knowing that your skills and hard work made it happen is incredible.\n[S4T13] (dia_id: D4:13)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, Dave! Feels good when our hard work pays off. It's the perfect blend of dedication and passion!\n[S4T14] (dia_id: D4:14)","text_sha256":"2d7c2cf0c720c0268776fbe9b58c262195ad70a895307530e24c2b1009798043","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":522,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":11192,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":11